classDiagram
  accTitle: Editor view, commands and note repository
  accDescr: EditorView dispatches StateCommand objects and reads notes from a Repo of Note; MarkdownFormatting implements the StateCommand interface.
  class StateCommand {
    <<interface>>
    +run(ctx: Context) boolean
  }
  class EditorView {
    +state: EditorState
    +dispatch(tr: Transaction) void
    +focus() void
  }
  class MarkdownFormatting {
    +toggleBold() boolean
    +insertLink(url: string) boolean
    +run(ctx: Context) boolean
  }
  class Repo~T~ {
    +find(id: string) T
  }
  EditorView --> StateCommand : dispatches
  MarkdownFormatting ..|> StateCommand
  EditorView --> Repo : reads Repo#lt;Note#gt;
